BEHAVIOR socket

DESCRIPTION
  Creates a network socket.
  Domain: AF_INET (2), AF_INET6 (10), AF_UNIX (1).
  Type: SOCK_STREAM (1), SOCK_DGRAM (2).
  Returns socket file descriptor, negative on error.

CONTRACT
  INPUT domain int 8
  INPUT sock_type int 8
  OUTPUT fd int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 0fec0e0c

NATIVE
